  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize emptying a pile. An empty pile is a powerful tool to swap cards. Dig for Aces immediately. Don't bury low cards under high cards unless necessary.\n\nThe 'Reverse Build': If you have an empty column, you can reverse a sequence (e.g., move 4-3-2 to empty spots to get the 2 onto a foundation).\n\nLookahead: Since all cards are visible, check if moving a 7 will trap a needed 2. Plan 5-10 moves ahead.",
